 * Unit tests for js/common/smRuleLayers.js (gh-1114).
 *
 * The SM tick runs in layers: L0 hygiene → L1 freshness → L2 verdict →
 * L3 dispatch → L4 agents → L5 close. Freshness before verdicts: a head
