``
Returns {decision: 'transplant'|'skip'|'park'|'refuse'|'noop', reason, branch, prTitle, prBody, carry: {...}, comment}.

Decision order (matches ACs):
1. state !== 'OPEN' → skip 'closed-source' (AC5).
2. already has live transplant (openMachinePr) or marker with same (source, headSha) → noop 'already-transplanted' (snapshot semantics AC5).
3. draft → skip.
4. label present? (checked by query; but the plan double-checks cfg.label in labels) → skip otherwise.
5. machine actor armed it (armEvent actor in machineLogins) → refuse, audit only (AC5).
6. same-repo head (not cross-repo) → skip + audit (E3).
7. noRef (source branch deleted / head SHA unavailable) → park 'no-ref' (AC4 fallback).
8. conflict at merge time (execution-time outcome) → park 'conflict' (AC4).
9. else transplant with carry decision.

Also eligibility: cross-repo check `isCrossRepoHead(headRepo, owner, repo)`.

