3. Log audit. If refuse/nop/skip → return.
4. Execute steps in order with a switch:
  - comment → github_add_pr_comment (or the tracker's postComment)
  - add_label/remove_label → githubTracker().addLabel/removeLabel
  - create_ref → resolve main head sha (gh api branches/main --jq .commit.sha), exec buildCreateRefCommand
