  - transplant_comment → buildTransplantComment({sourceSha: sha used, mergedSha, transplantPrNumber, carriedLabels}) + post on source.
  - close_pr → exec buildClosePrCommand.
  - delete_ref → exec buildDeleteRefCommand.
  - complete_orphan → expand: merge + open_pr + carry_decision + transplant_comment + close_pr (reuse the executor on synthesized steps).
