Cleaner: fold GC into the MAIN rule's pre-step (once per tick, before the query). One rule total, one hook, sweep + label patch + inert gate all in the pre-step. The ticket's "branch GC" is core scope; it doesn't mandate a separate rule. And "limit 1 per tick (a transplant creates a PR + closes another — serial by construction)" — one rule. DECISION: single rule `guest-transplant`, GC swept in the rule pre-step. No L0 registration needed then — just L4 'guest-transplant'.

